{
 "name": "Turn PDF invoices from Gmail into text and log them in Google Sheets",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "about-this-workflow",
   "name": "About this workflow",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -640,
    100
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## PDF invoices from Gmail to text\n\nWhen an email with a PDF arrives, this workflow extracts the text of the PDF (no OCR needed for digital invoices) and logs it in a Google Sheet with the sender, subject and page count. Scanned pages are listed so you know when a document needs OCR.\n\n### Setup (5 minutes)\n1. Connect Gmail in **New email with a PDF**. The search `has:attachment filename:pdf` only picks emails with a PDF; narrow it, e.g. `from:billing@supplier.com`.\n2. Make a sheet with the columns `received`, `from`, `subject`, `pages`, `scanned_pages`, `text` and pick it in **Log the invoice**.\n3. In **PDF to text**, create a CompassLab credential: free plan on api.market or RapidAPI.\n\nOnly the first attachment is read. Next step idea: send `text` to an AI node to pull out the invoice number, date and total.",
    "width": 560,
    "height": 520,
    "color": "6"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "new-email-with-a-pdf",
   "name": "New email with a PDF",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    0,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "url": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9309.pdf",
    "options": {
     "response": {
      "response": {
       "responseFormat": "file",
       "outputPropertyName": "attachment_0"
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "pdf-to-text",
   "name": "PDF to text",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-compasslab.compassLab",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    240,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "resource": "pdf",
    "operation": "extractText",
    "source": "binary",
    "binaryPropertyName": "attachment_0",
    "format": "text"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "log-the-invoice",
   "name": "Log the invoice",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
   "typeVersion": 3.4,
   "position": [
    480,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "assignments": {
     "assignments": [
      {
       "id": "received",
       "name": "received",
       "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "from",
       "name": "from",
       "value": "={{ $('New email with a PDF').item.json.from?.text ?? '' }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "subject",
       "name": "subject",
       "value": "={{ $('New email with a PDF').item.json.subject ?? '' }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "pages",
       "name": "pages",
       "value": "={{ $json.page_count }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "scanned_pages",
       "name": "scanned_pages",
       "value": "={{ $json.scanned_pages.join(', ') }}",
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "id": "text",
       "name": "text",
       "value": "={{ ($json.text ?? '').slice(0, 45000) }}",
       "type": "string"
      }
     ]
    },
    "options": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "start",
   "name": "Start",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -240,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {}
  }
 ],
 "connections": {
  "Start": {
   "main": [
    [
     {
      "node": "New email with a PDF",
      "type": "main",
      "index": 0
     }
    ]
   ]
  },
  "New email with a PDF": {
   "main": [
    [
     {
      "node": "PDF to text",
      "type": "main",
      "index": 0
     }
    ]
   ]
  },
  "PDF to text": {
   "main": [
    [
     {
      "node": "Log the invoice",
      "type": "main",
      "index": 0
     }
    ]
   ]
  }
 },
 "settings": {
  "executionOrder": "v1"
 },
 "meta": {
  "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
  "description": "Extracts the text of PDF attachments from Gmail with the CompassLab node (PDF) and logs sender, subject, pages, scanned pages and text in a Google Sheet."
 }
}
